// Corpus for lib/fail.js - looksFailed(). This file is byte-for-byte identical
// in persistence-self-monitoring and epistemic-self-monitoring, so it is the
// single most load-bearing detector in the collection: both the "same command
// failing" counter and the epistemic observe nudge hang off it.
//
// The rule it must honour: never fire on the bare words "error" or "failed".
// A green Jest run prints "0 failed"; a grep for "error handling" prints the
// word. Every rule is line-anchored.

